-- ============================================================================
-- v1398: Seed / sample data — Operational Readiness registers (v1397) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-09: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each of the nine
-- Operational Readiness registers, for SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge Bank" core banking
-- replacement, go-live weekend 9–12 April 2027, the same scenario as the Cutover, Testing and Data
-- Migration samples). Dated around today (9 Nov 2026): a few SOPs are approved, super-user training
-- and the all-staff awareness module are under way, early monitoring and incident items are set up,
-- two sign-offs are done. Most branch, contact centre and process items are being prepared for the
-- January to March 2027 training and the dress rehearsals.
-- Records: sops 10, process 10, training 10, branch 10, contact 10, support 10, monitoring 10, incident 10, signoff 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-b029- … b031- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated percentages are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1397. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

